#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-gui.rst:5 2d9c615e8e364e34aad711b2f4d15134
msgid "DroneCAN GUI"
msgstr "DroneCAN GUI"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-gui.rst:7 377a90f4b63047398501d5a3056fe774
msgid ""
"DroneCAN_GUI is a tool that allows viewing, configuration and software "
"updates of nodes connected to the BUS."
msgstr "DroneCAN_GUI 是一款用于查看、配置和更新连接到总线上节点软件的工具。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-gui.rst:10 7ccceca5cb6a4e88922e17432bf09864
msgid ""
"Windows: Download `DroneCAN_GUI "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/CAN_GUI/>`_ and install."
msgstr ""
"Windows：下载 `DroneCAN_GUI <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/CAN_GUI/>`_ "
"并安装。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-gui.rst:11 6fc887a468734239b925b0ac26fe4211
msgid "Linux: python3 -m pip install dronecan_gui_tool dronecan"
msgstr "Linux：python3 -m pip install dronecan_gui_tool dronecan"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-gui.rst:13 161d46ae44a64ec2b767c69b16e37420
msgid ""
"Before the autopilot can be connected, SLCAN mode must be operational. See "
":ref:`common-slcan-f4` or :ref:`common-slcan-f7h7` for setup information."
msgstr ""
"连接飞控前，必须启用 SLCAN 模式。设置信息请参见 :ref:`common-slcan-f4` 或 :ref:`common-"
"slcan-f7h7`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-gui.rst:15 52dcb97e4ae74909963341add7e89d8f
msgid ""
"Start DroneCAN GUI and select the correct USB port for the SLCAN interface. "
"The default CAN bus bit rate of 1,000,000 wont  need to be changed unless "
"the :ref:`CAN_P1_BITRATE<CAN_P1_BITRATE>` or "
":ref:`CAN_P2_BITRATE<CAN_P2_BITRATE>` (if using the second autopilot CAN "
"port) has been changed. The Adapter baud rate should match the autopilot's "
"SERIALx port baud rate. The default value of 115.2KBaud should be correct."
msgstr ""
"启动 DroneCAN GUI 并为 SLCAN 接口选择正确的 USB 端口。默认 CAN 总线波特率为 1,000,000，除非 "
":ref:`CAN_P1_BITRATE<CAN_P1_BITRATE>` 或 "
":ref:`CAN_P2_BITRATE<CAN_P2_BITRATE>`（使用第二个飞控 CAN "
"端口时）已被更改，否则无需修改。适配器波特率应与飞控的 SERIALx 端口波特率一致，默认值 115.2KBaud 应正确。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-gui.rst:17 682112a6dd8746b2b72a36f92a07192c
msgid ""
"Almost all ArduPilot autopilots use VCP USB connections and Adapter port "
"baud rate value is irrelevant and can be any value."
msgstr "几乎所有 ArduPilot 飞控都使用 VCP USB 连接，适配器端口波特率值无关紧要，可以是任意值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-gui.rst:21 96c3d8a1aade43369d1bf7972b1ae398
msgid ""
"DroneCAN_GUI tool will start with an interface as the image below. Click on "
"tick box next to Local node ID. Leave it unchanged, unless you have another "
"node on the CANBUS with the same address."
msgstr ""
"DroneCAN_GUI 工具启动后界面如下图所示。点击 Local node ID 旁边的勾选框。除非 CANBUS "
"上有另一个具有相同地址的节点，否则保持不变。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-gui.rst:26 9b164344005546bf8bf4899de56c49bb
msgid ""
"If the node has a bootloader only installed, then firmware will need to be "
"uploaded. ``MAINTENANCE`` will be displayed. Firmware can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AP_Periph/>`__ and downloaded for the node."
"  Click on the button lower right and then double click on "
"``org.ardupilot.ap_periph`` as highlighted."
msgstr ""
"如果节点只安装了引导程序，则需要上传固件。将显示 ``MAINTENANCE``。可从 `此处 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AP_Periph/>`__ 下载节点固件。点击右下方按钮，然后双击高亮显示的 "
"``org.ardupilot.ap_periph``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-gui.rst:31 7520e0f7830d4f849b3a3501eb311b8b
msgid ""
"The following pop up window will appear. Click on update firmware and select"
" the correct file for the node connected."
msgstr "将弹出以下窗口。点击 update firmware 并选择已连接节点的正确文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-gui.rst:33 5fdd43a74e254aefb5af82c6c1e8ccb0
msgid ""
"If you have trouble updating firmware, trying renaming the firmware filename"
" to something very short, such as \"a.bin\". Longer filenames sometimes have"
" difficulty loading."
msgstr "如果固件更新遇到问题，请尝试将固件文件名重命名为非常短的名称，例如 「a.bin」。较长的文件名有时加载困难。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-gui.rst:38 12d32bf9489548308beda511f8ecdc86
msgid ""
"Once the firmware has finished uploading to node the main window will change"
" to ``OPERATIONAL`` as per image below. Press the ``Fetch All`` button, and "
"double click on the FLASH_BOOTLOADER parameter and enter 1 in the "
"highlighted box. Press ``Send`` and close the dialog. The address of the "
"node can be changed in this window to avoid conflict with another node on "
"the CANBUS, as well as any DroneCAN device specific parameters."
msgstr ""
"固件上传到节点完成后，主窗口将变为 ``OPERATIONAL``，如下图所示。点击 ``Fetch All`` 按钮，双击 "
"FLASH_BOOTLOADER 参数，在高亮框中输入 1。点击 ``Send`` 并关闭对话框。在此窗口中可更改节点地址以避免与 CANBUS "
"上其他节点冲突，以及修改任何 DroneCAN 设备特定参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-gui.rst:42 1209379b3904443987aead718a93e467
msgid "A debug message will show complete."
msgstr "将显示调试完成消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-gui.rst:46 ecb7de46482e44b7bdaa3add049f4d68
msgid ""
"Messages coming through the CANBUS can be viewed using the bus monitor tool "
"in \"Tools\" menu."
msgstr "可通过 「Tools」 菜单中的总线监视工具查看 CANBUS 上传输的消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-uavcan-gui.rst:50 ce31a4b8370b4360897e7db46eaaee83
msgid "To return to normal operation, close the DroneCAN_GUI tool."
msgstr "若要恢复正常操作，请关闭 DroneCAN_GUI 工具。"
